{
  "name": "Lead Intake",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 · Lead Intake\nReceives leads from two sources and turns them into one format.\n\n- **Lead Form** (n8n Form) and **Gmail Trigger** (label `Leads`, checked every minute)\n- **Normalize** nodes map both sources to the same 13 fields\n- **Pre-filter** drops obvious spam for free, before any AI call: invalid email, disposable domain, message under 15 characters, no-reply sender, your own address\n- Spam → **Spam log** · real leads → **Lead Processing**\n\n**Setup:** put your inbox address in `OWN_EMAILS` (Pre-filter), then choose your Gmail label, spreadsheet and the Lead Processing workflow.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 760
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1680,
        -840
